Backport of the six fs/ntfs3 fixes in ../7.3/ to Linux 7.2.11 (one patch).

Same changes as the 7.3 series; context differs where 7.2.11 has no ADS
names in these call sites (NULL, 0 instead of ni->file.ads.*), uses
'unsigned long ino' in readdir, and lacks the is_ni_base() check in
ni_write_parents().  Build-tested as an out-of-tree module against
linux-headers 7.2.11-arch1-1 (W=1, no warnings).

Apply from a kernel source root with: patch -p1 < ntfs3-fixes-7.2.11.patch

